---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../components/Navbar.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="yaopulife Privacy Policy - How we collect, use, and protect your personal information.">
  <Navbar />

  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-gray-500">Last updated: June 2026</p>

      <div class="mt-12 prose prose-lg text-gray-600">

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We collect information you provide directly to us when you:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Fill out our contact or custom phone case request forms</li>
          <li>Subscribe to our email newsletter (your email is stored locally until our email service is connected)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>This may include your name, email address, and custom requirements. We do not currently offer user accounts, and we do not collect phone numbers or passwords.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to your inquiries and process custom orders</li>
          <li>To send AI design previews and order updates</li>
          <li>To send marketing emails (only if you subscribe and only after our email service is active)</li>
          <li>To improve our website and services</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">3. Cookies and Analytics</h2>
        <p>We use essential cookies for website functionality. We also use Google Analytics through Google tag (gtag.js) to understand how visitors use our site. Analytics data is collected only with your consent, which you can manage through our cookie banner or your browser settings.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">4. Data Storage and Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>Your data is stored securely with our service providers, which may include website hosting, analytics, email, and content management services. Our website is hosted on Vercel, which may process data on servers located in different countries. We rely on our service providers to maintain appropriate data protection measures.</p>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information. We only share data with third parties to the extent necessary to operate our website and fulfill your requests.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">5. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to access, correct, or delete your personal data. Contact us at hello@yaopulife.com for any privacy-related requests. We will respond within a reasonable time.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated effective date.</p>

        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mt-8">7. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at <a href="mailto:hello@yaopulife.com" class="text-brand-600">hello@yaopulife.com</a>.</p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
